			<div class="content" id="post-content-4824617">
									

<p>Here are my thoughts on 5944;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Line&nbsp;by&nbsp;Line</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Line&nbsp;by&nbsp;Line</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>openable only to on-site staff with Level 5 clearance or above</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Very strange that only O5 council members can access the SCP's containment seeing how they generally aren't supposed to come in contact with anomalies.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-5944 is a tactile cognitohazard in the form of an anomalous translucent crystal.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This sentence doesn't make sense to me. Is it a crystal with a cognitohazardous effect, because this sentence seems to imply that the crystal itself is like the physical embodiment of the cognitohazard or something?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">General&nbsp;Thoughts</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">General&nbsp;Thoughts</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The description is simply put, painful to get through. I'd say you could cut at least half of those words out and it'd still make just as much sense. There is no hook; some kind of mystery in the conprocs to pull you through all of that. By the second paragraph, I already understood what it was. None of the rest was necessary.</p>
<p>The anomaly itself is generic and boring. It's a crystal that turns people into zombies, and this skip does nothing interesting with it. The interview and experiment logs all blur together. It's just zombies being zombies. It's exactly what I expected based on the description. There is no twist or subversion. It doesn't lead anywhere. I suppose the final addendum is supposed to be some kind of conclusion but I honestly have no idea what it means.</p>
<p>I can't really suggest specific changes because I think the idea itself needs major reworking. I recommend checking out the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Ideas Forum</a> if you want some advice from experienced authors.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

